{"id": "16-937-2-4", "zh": "yudha（词根），用于“战斗”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-937-5-6", "zh": "yodhati（他战斗）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-937-7-8", "zh": "yodha（战士）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-937-9-12", "zh": "“要用智慧的武器与魔罗作战。”", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-937-13-14", "zh": "yuddha（战斗）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-937-15-19", "zh": "caraṇāyudha，或者 caraṇāvudha（以爪为武器的，即公鸡）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-937-20-21", "zh": "āvudha（武器）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-937-22-32", "zh": "不过，这个词根归入 divādi 类（第四类动词）时，它的形式是“yujjhati”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-938-2-4", "zh": "dīdhi（词根），用于“照耀”和“穿透”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-938-5-6", "zh": "dīdhati（它照耀）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-938-7-8", "zh": "dīdhiti（光芒）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-938-9-14", "zh": "这里的 **dīdhiti** 指的是光线。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-938-15-18", "zh": "因为光线有许多名称：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-939-2-11", "zh": "rasmi、ābhā、pabhā、raṃsi，ditti、bhā、ruci、dīdhiti；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-940-2-11", "zh": "marīci、juti、bhāṇu、aṃsu，mayūkha、kiraṇa、kara；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-941-2-8", "zh": "还有 nāgadhāma 和 āloka，这些都是表示光线的词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-942-2-3", "zh": "以上是以 ca 字母结尾的词根形式。", "confidence": 45}
